ixl@rice-chex.ai.mit.edu (Charles M Kozierok) writes:

>1. Is there any way to polymorph on demand, or is it just random?
>   I have a ring of poly and also poly control.  Can either
>   be gained as intrinsics?

I don't think either of them can become intrinsic. But if you have a
wand of polymorph, you can zap yourself (.) and that's your polymorph
on demand.

>   Is there any way, other than walking around without armor on,
>   to prevent the armor that I wear as a human from getting wrecked

Well.. there is ONE thing, since you have the ring of polymorph control:
Only polymorph to creatures that can wear all the armor that humans do.

>2. What is good to polymorph into?

Hmm.. seems that there are almost half as many opinions of THE BEST monsters
as there are different monsters.. there are many good choices, although some
of them have some drawbacks. My favorite is vampire lord. They can wear all
the armor (and even naked they have Ac better than humans), they can fly over
water, they drain levels..

>4. Is there any way to bless items other than dipping them in holy water,
>   which seems to use up the holy water?  How can I generate new potions
>   of water/holy water?

No other way that ALWAYS works. Your god MAY do that for you, but it doesn't
happen too often. You can dilute any other potion in fountains, and when
you do it twice, it becomes water. Then you can make the water holy by
dropping it on an altar of your own alignment and praying, if your prayer
timeout has expired.

